## Overview

IntelliStream – Distributed AI Event Processing Platform

• Built a real-time distributed event processing platform using Kafka, FastAPI, PostgreSQL, Redis, Docker and Streamlit.

• Designed producer-consumer architecture with Kafka Consumer Groups and multi-threaded consumers for concurrent event processing.

• Integrated AI-based risk prediction to analyze live animal health telemetry events.

• Developed REST APIs, monitoring endpoints and interactive dashboards for analytics and visualization.

• Implemented Redis caching, logging, benchmarking and health monitoring to improve system reliability and performance.

• Containerized services using Docker and deployed backend, dashboard and database on Render cloud.

Tech Stack: Python, Kafka, FastAPI, PostgreSQL, Redis, Docker, Streamlit, Render, Machine Learning
